  "body": "## What changed\n\nThe release gate discovers known failures from structured test ignore reasons.\nEach marker names the upstream issue, cargo target, full test name, and expected panic prefix.\nAn assertion comment pins the expected source line.\nBoth release commands check the issue state before they run the gate.\nThe review rules reject tests that start red with a plain ignore.\n\n## Cause\n\nThe cut gate used a fixed list of three tests for issue #1950.\nThe release command did not check their issue state.\n\n## Tests\n\n- `source_marker_adds_a_known_fail_without_a_skip_list` failed on unchanged code. It passes with the fix.\n- `malformed_known_fail_markers_are_refused` checks marker syntax, fields, issue numbers, test names, and assertion markers.\n- `closed_known_fail_issue_refuses_the_gate` checks closed issues and dry runs.\n- `a_known_fail_step_is_ok_only_when_its_test_fails` checks passing tests, crashes, other tests, other assertions, and panic prefixes.\n- `release_command_checks_known_fail_issues_before_the_gate` checks the release command and malformed-marker refusal.\n- All 14 mutation checks failed with the guard removed. Each pin passed after restoration.\n- The release mutation restored the complete upstream release module.\n- The assertion mutation restored the upstream executor with ownership changes needed for discovered data.\n- `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main` passed all 121 steps.\n- The final test-only edit passed `cargo xtask gate quick --base upstream/main --only xtask`.\n- `cargo clippy -p xtask -p camcraft-app -p camcraft-motion --all-targets -- -D warnings` passed.\n\n## Goldens moved\n\nNone. The `.nc` and `.cl` diff is empty.\n\n## Not exercised\n\nThe full release gate and its three heavy tests did not run.\nIssue-state pins use injected states. They do not change GitHub issues.\nThe existing warning remains when `gh` cannot read an issue state.\nThe branch starts at `136f19763`. PRs #2652 and #2654 merged during the gate and are not included in this branch.\n\n## Overlaps\n\nNone. No open PR changes a touched file.\n\nProcess change: yes\nEffort: medium\nChangelog: The release gate discovers known-fail test markers and checks their issues in both release commands.\n\nFixes #2567\n",
